							“I never messed with augs, and typically was in the top 10 for RN stats wise most of the time. Only time I started to aug my gear was when GoD augs started dropping, those were a better time investment.”<br /><br />All your 20+ pieces of gear were fully filled with GoD Augs? Never got a weapon aug ?  Don’t know how you can say GoD augs were a better time investment if you are taking about the GoD raids ones that’s maybe 3 HP augs up till qivic an they are lore and you have to win them. The rest are 25-30 hp augs from single grp named.<br /><br />“LDoN gave the casual person who liked to group something, it gave nothing to others, and in reality, the rewards from LDoN were questionable at best. “<br /><br />LDON was extremely popular when it came out. The camps were packed. Easy to find grps at all times of the day, and the gear was great for non raiding types and even had to be tuned down when high end folks complained. As for higher end folks look at the stats all the top guild folks, they were among the top ranked. Folks with weapon augs, HP augs, Spells, even armor. The Plate BP was in the&nbsp; top 4 outside of time. <br /><br />I liked LDoN and for me the rewards were fine. <br /><br /><br />I do think they should think about adding some slightly improved gear / augs, i.e. 60 hp.<br /><br /><br />Will this tiopic ever return.....<br /><br />
